  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.7125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have seen no story of the war which, within its limits, has pleased me more than that which Mr. Alfred Noyes told in the newspapers in his fascinating description of his visit to the Fleet.",
      "output_sha256": "2ae9db754af473bf0c91bad4aee0e79c307ce29df3dda88a3031eb95c4f215e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ae9db754af473bf0c91bad4aee0e79c307ce29df3dda88a3031eb95c4f215e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was a story of the battle of Jutland.",
      "output_sha256": "f51921e467c278aab32aff2edf44f39943579ff571acf97bce310eb518b02c55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "f51921e467c278aab32aff2edf44f39943579ff571acf97bce310eb518b02c55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"In the very hottest moment of this most stupendous battle in all history,\" he says, \"two grimy stokers' heads arose for a breath of fresh air.",
      "output_sha256": "9989a60ff40dfdacfd5c248461c06b0661a35d337bc2b99d0d06438fd5663891",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "9989a60ff40dfdacfd5c248461c06b0661a35d337bc2b99d0d06438fd5663891",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What domestic drama they were discussing the world may never know.",
      "output_sha256": "98116ed4b9c148639864c75a9f03af20fb59223130375b813cec71fceeb51cac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "98116ed4b9c148639864c75a9f03af20fb59223130375b813cec71fceeb51cac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the words that were actually heard passing between them, while the shells whined overhead, were these: 'What I says is, 'e ought to have married 'er.'\"",
      "output_sha256": "2a5b267b1ec041e3e218d927e25f2c82f7daf9ddcebc17356cdcf889a4b9ba54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a5b267b1ec041e3e218d927e25f2c82f7daf9ddcebc17356cdcf889a4b9ba54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If you find this story unappealing, you will struggle to grasp the essence of the English spirit.",
      "output_sha256": "5cf745b168f6437a19e4ac0515cd0d66cc19b45053c94e1d9451236c64994430",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.535249,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ffbc3b0e38e7ada62167a8ffcfafe17bb633df0a7ba7ca4ee01422102ef8ccfb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5cf745b168f6437a19e4ac0515cd0d66cc19b45053c94e1d9451236c64994430",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There are some among us who never will understand the English spirit.",
      "output_sha256": "09d888e7bab3ed10056ba1f8a72ae85c6133bcfb51d408c1a83118afadc41f92",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "09d888e7bab3ed10056ba1f8a72ae85c6133bcfb51d408c1a83118afadc41f92",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the early days of the war an excellent friend of mine used to find a great source of despair in \"Tipperary.\"",
      "output_sha256": "aec02176a5fd8ed48692990dcba2cb2f55d14d40268df76ba9ee9eab0d6cc77f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "aec02176a5fd8ed48692990dcba2cb2f55d14d40268df76ba9ee9eab0d6cc77f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He questioned how a nation could send its soldiers into battle singing \"Tipperary\" when their opponents marched forward chanting \"Ein' feste Burg.\"",
      "output_sha256": "efa91b2693603c6058f1c62712232888a57189623362551881ac3d8de80cf549",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.450624,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b6c6fc83c65a7c425c61bf3a3041d8d9513683ef1eb4976261c6d01edb7fe16e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "efa91b2693603c6058f1c62712232888a57189623362551881ac3d8de80cf549",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Put that way, I was bound to confess that the case looked black against us.",
      "output_sha256": "09a72da85f463938dcad6791af4c8e3d6f99504b0966d23d73514e57f983f486",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "09a72da85f463938dcad6791af4c8e3d6f99504b0966d23d73514e57f983f486",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It seemed \"all Lombard Street to a China orange,\" as an old saying goes.",
      "output_sha256": "63a2dc9e213698d59d03285a3e0fd7443c2e3890acfcdb6b00a402bf9fc563bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.615377,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4b59eec905b521cf2e36ed233bfe9448af9b149b4cfcf8ab5835c594b532f57d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "63a2dc9e213698d59d03285a3e0fd7443c2e3890acfcdb6b00a402bf9fc563bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While \"Tipperary\" was somewhat refreshing and original for a music-hall tune, it stood in stark contrast to the sentimental \"Keep the home fires burning,\" which dominates today’s landscape.",
      "output_sha256": "a7de8196c97109b691bc10597b7d5bb3bdaf83a1ce194b26e2b2222d505015c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.427142,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "000dc7d5788b3ad5f34123084b55422ae434b39e018033f6deaebae506cf2bb9",
        "e672cd730de78c5b40c3d10099ee5ae2b090d06b58592e563aefb1b3b4861ca7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a7de8196c97109b691bc10597b7d5bb3bdaf83a1ce194b26e2b2222d505015c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I never hear it even now on the street organ without a certain pleasure—a pleasure mingled with pain, for its happy lilt comes weighted with the tremendous emotions of those unforgettable days.",
      "output_sha256": "8d8b1e2ba9c0fc6e61f78610b95c53dfb97c34cebbe31d0b629a27c051c0f7a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d8b1e2ba9c0fc6e61f78610b95c53dfb97c34cebbe31d0b629a27c051c0f7a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is like a butterfly caught in a tornado, a catch of song in the throat of death.",
      "output_sha256": "50470d21fa387f7eeea21b1c9096aef71de07f1a23aff0bf62d4a5430c31ed59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "50470d21fa387f7eeea21b1c9096aef71de07f1a23aff0bf62d4a5430c31ed59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But it was only a music-hall song after all, and to put it in competition with Luther's mighty hymn would be like putting a pop-gun against a 12-inch howitzer.",
      "output_sha256": "075754048d59665e28497f87230b46add6891e3e3b09fbb516db8881be86a20b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "075754048d59665e28497f87230b46add6891e3e3b09fbb516db8881be86a20b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The resonance of Luther's hymn has echoed through four centuries and will continue to reverberate through time until the end of days.",
      "output_sha256": "62d39a9da33ff4bf24ee2b24e72256dd9f8efed69935ddff2412cb30d86da710",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.614085,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "628a7b7928c2c0bdabea4d38675b7f8bcd3fba70d7d3937369f6a95e76291607"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "62d39a9da33ff4bf24ee2b24e72256dd9f8efed69935ddff2412cb30d86da710",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It embodies the epic clash of elements, akin to the rumble of mountains and the swell of oceans.",
      "output_sha256": "b55915b46ea062553cd4eade8194d140d151d06d4e08e179e4b8704fbb6339eb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.531128,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cc12c0bfb6f793c680cd5382448edf3989e401bea7d93bc4fa89423186feec31"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b55915b46ea062553cd4eade8194d140d151d06d4e08e179e4b8704fbb6339eb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In nothing else is the sense of Power so embodied in the pulse of song.",
      "output_sha256": "f528e230916511dbb008a3a9e8cccbb018387e93ad2921ac1dab0c7fd2cef2ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "f528e230916511dbb008a3a9e8cccbb018387e93ad2921ac1dab0c7fd2cef2ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And the words are as formidable as the tune.",
      "output_sha256": "f544b552a5109e762600768b66f53280c62d634f163ce917d4fb294d116ecd5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "f544b552a5109e762600768b66f53280c62d634f163ce917d4fb294d116ecd5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Carlyle captured their raw, robust strength in his renowned translation:",
      "output_sha256": "dedfb03e2dcf27a70fec9e1d33399685d70a012a8c63e8f965d8e483179d1998",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.601818,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fb2ed5d0f79bf045710e87d4c56c8c34918e0d7533fd9e9d5100e336bc50a292"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dedfb03e2dcf27a70fec9e1d33399685d70a012a8c63e8f965d8e483179d1998",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A safe stronghold our God is still, A trusty shield and weapon; He'll help us clear from all the ill That hath us now o'ertaken….",
      "output_sha256": "2572dcb04a083b9b3c398bed2ab5c0ee0f473c04938a8ba7efcbe21eb7c96613",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "2572dcb04a083b9b3c398bed2ab5c0ee0f473c04938a8ba7efcbe21eb7c96613",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yes, on the face of it, it seemed a poor lookout for \"Tipperary\" against such a foe.",
      "output_sha256": "7bb433f70e978aa52ee40c67e2cfc15a5f4539cdba44414cffcfe0dee56c6322",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "7bb433f70e978aa52ee40c67e2cfc15a5f4539cdba44414cffcfe0dee56c6322",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, those familiar with the English temperament understood that it was not as dire as it seemed.",
      "output_sha256": "05ea25a475e92f24be71aabf02a3b420d7b9971ecd46dee4fdc279df11880a63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.455335,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b735da785ad0128972d08a58b699dcb252ee01c027c98601acb6acd26d384d0c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "05ea25a475e92f24be71aabf02a3b420d7b9971ecd46dee4fdc279df11880a63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I set aside the notion that a light-hearted tune is far more effective than a solemn one for practical purposes.",
      "output_sha256": "32853a93e79bfcd4651b450709e01b465954fa214861b6de5c0c5c1745e802fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.455335,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b735da785ad0128972d08a58b699dcb252ee01c027c98601acb6acd26d384d0c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "32853a93e79bfcd4651b450709e01b465954fa214861b6de5c0c5c1745e802fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"Tipperary\" lifts the spirits and quickens the pace, while Luther’s hymn would weigh heavily upon one’s journey.",
      "output_sha256": "dd4afd4e962be04da91be2298a55f76194391fbb34aeb01570bbd77028184a43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.36221,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f8131ca3290570ba9df77d4dbba3fab622b2ca732100437046b45c24331e08ca",
        "36516b6c67ed89553dd4ee13d420f35f99f76554849e09b0ee1e784e4a6e68ce"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dd4afd4e962be04da91be2298a55f76194391fbb34aeb01570bbd77028184a43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The mind would struggle under its gravity; one might either descend into madness or resort to reckless behavior to regain composure.",
      "output_sha256": "c2f1ff82d28e45bbd7a3d4b05d4601f0424c7280a949c253513489cd5dc6249b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.435,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "544e3d770e2202d2eb67edd5281fda729d1cfb2ef7c65c12fcf6edcc9faad756",
        "82f5afe31d959d9287137a3c18a5641b1a8347884473b37b75a4b4525abe8296"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c2f1ff82d28e45bbd7a3d4b05d4601f0424c7280a949c253513489cd5dc6249b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is the craziest of philosophy to think that because you are engaged in a serious business you have to live in a state of exaltation, that the bow is never to be unstrung, that the top note is never to be relaxed.",
      "output_sha256": "0ea327aebcb664d5e7ced0fddabfa36f422cf058bab843e5b3fbb39a9f1fb926",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ea327aebcb664d5e7ced0fddabfa36f422cf058bab843e5b3fbb39a9f1fb926",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You will not do your business better because you wear a long face all the time; you will do it worse.",
      "output_sha256": "f89fb651b82476f7daa302a41bcc21e09bdea3646a9c6110842a927b952bfb61",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "f89fb651b82476f7daa302a41bcc21e09bdea3646a9c6110842a927b952bfb61",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If you are talking about your high ideals all day you are not only a nuisance: you are either dishonest or unbalanced.",
      "output_sha256": "40a5f7518175641dc9d4bbe051f1d340b190f82294a97998ba169acf8b46276b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "40a5f7518175641dc9d4bbe051f1d340b190f82294a97998ba169acf8b46276b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We are not creatures with wings.",
      "output_sha256": "0cc081e0184051046b9471cf9906cf66c0d7b68a2a7eef6b4ce8b5ab8355f117",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "0cc081e0184051046b9471cf9906cf66c0d7b68a2a7eef6b4ce8b5ab8355f117",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We are creatures who walk.",
      "output_sha256": "f05e84f7e5bd0f1b1d611b566e47cb2320217a7f9f9e8114eaba1fcd8f52dfd5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "f05e84f7e5bd0f1b1d611b566e47cb2320217a7f9f9e8114eaba1fcd8f52dfd5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We have to \"foot it\" even to Mount Pisgah, and the more cheerful and jolly and ordinary we are on the way the sooner we shall get over the journey.",
      "output_sha256": "b98f801fa6e38434ebde62e76c4d2d0fe46a6692f2a93fdc7b5f59e7851c4037",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "b98f801fa6e38434ebde62e76c4d2d0fe46a6692f2a93fdc7b5f59e7851c4037",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The noblest Englishman that ever lived, and the most deeply serious, was as full of innocent mirth as a child and laid his head down on the block with a jest.",
      "output_sha256": "39fe4093e5780b7fc1a35661a2451fdcb4c1d70903038aef3c2c7b51988a38aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "39fe4093e5780b7fc1a35661a2451fdcb4c1d70903038aef3c2c7b51988a38aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let us keep our course by the stars, by all means, but the immediate tasks are much nearer than the stars—",
      "output_sha256": "a9864fb9d31818b33be9ed42417ecc3d05255bef55d33cb7491da6388c1a6acf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9864fb9d31818b33be9ed42417ecc3d05255bef55d33cb7491da6388c1a6acf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The charities that soothe and heal and bless Are scattered all about our feet—like flowers.",
      "output_sha256": "83ed39dc98b06da20e4ed48c10505f47f321cfba1d8b21de827e34380d904b99",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "83ed39dc98b06da20e4ed48c10505f47f321cfba1d8b21de827e34380d904b99",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is precisely the dark gravity of the German psyche that has driven them to madness.",
      "output_sha256": "245e51ff13cefbf90155233ec28495a97ab89e1dfc96d9fbc95429e6a0481f75",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.54879,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0f688fdfc3170c6b58ac9bb603525cf51a2cded31fb382705e361a89bc1772b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "245e51ff13cefbf90155233ec28495a97ab89e1dfc96d9fbc95429e6a0481f75",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They haven't learned to play; they haven't learned to laugh at themselves.",
      "output_sha256": "b7a71c586dc5010348438f595b641485fc9c31caf82bde444254bbdd2453131f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7a71c586dc5010348438f595b641485fc9c31caf82bde444254bbdd2453131f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Their sombre religion has passed into a sombre irreligion.",
      "output_sha256": "81e2d2b81de7280b24f8192056bedc2ae5c425ea7909c5bfbe70cf4ffee1dfce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "81e2d2b81de7280b24f8192056bedc2ae5c425ea7909c5bfbe70cf4ffee1dfce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They have grown gross without growing light-hearted.",
      "output_sha256": "c661d9ab5d188ce9ba29bb99ae1ae1b39bbd8e838d852cc4ab45bf2fbbcfd5b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "c661d9ab5d188ce9ba29bb99ae1ae1b39bbd8e838d852cc4ab45bf2fbbcfd5b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The spiritual battle song of Luther has become a material battle song, and \"the safe stronghold\" is no longer the City of God but the City of Krupp.",
      "output_sha256": "a010a3fe17fb556e8576ab2019ccaaea31d1ae43e383de7dd397c0567e8b0e42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "a010a3fe17fb556e8576ab2019ccaaea31d1ae43e383de7dd397c0567e8b0e42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "They lack both the intellectual clarity of the French and the earthy humor that characterizes the English.",
      "output_sha256": "cfd558d25cb18a60ba9df9f114caea47ad927bd149235305a62d6024895e81d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.548235,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "72da498d0f9672eda946351353d906429b72cdd1a98a0288ca5a16b54e8bd5ab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cfd558d25cb18a60ba9df9f114caea47ad927bd149235305a62d6024895e81d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This very humor has posed a conundrum for Europe.",
      "output_sha256": "2b918b3abe7ed8deecdcac800f20ede17d124b633c2b4d2c59cef0e18c7eb1b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.404167,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ca695bb7f93c5e89eee0fcf5ae48b5927229091d7defa86138d6ef247ebd26a9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2b918b3abe7ed8deecdcac800f20ede17d124b633c2b4d2c59cef0e18c7eb1b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It has puzzled the French as much as the Germans, for the French genius is declamatory and needs the inspiration of ideas and great passions greatly stated.",
      "output_sha256": "8d6fd5d83e8502cc381a4982de3c1e54dc76d2e6dfe07ceff320b3dff10f2c92",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d6fd5d83e8502cc381a4982de3c1e54dc76d2e6dfe07ceff320b3dff10f2c92",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was assumed that, because the British soldier sang \"Tipperary,\" moved in an atmosphere of homely fun, indulged in no heroics, never talked of \"glory,\" rarely of patriotism or the Fatherland, and only joked about \"the flag,\" there was no great passion in him.",
      "output_sha256": "219921fedfa25831a5650272723458e407cb49949584b5c91dc2f23842cb518c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "219921fedfa25831a5650272723458e407cb49949584b5c91dc2f23842cb518c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Some of our frenzied people at home have the same idea.",
      "output_sha256": "a7e1cdbe6cb636aa6c101ff4e9e56ca1a553ef0a4167069ee6523fce00b6342d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "a7e1cdbe6cb636aa6c101ff4e9e56ca1a553ef0a4167069ee6523fce00b6342d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They still believe we are a nation of \"slackers\" because we don't shriek with them.",
      "output_sha256": "a1830450db3d60d234808bdebcab153de6165362f0b3ae300608b44f4e2a5fc6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1830450db3d60d234808bdebcab153de6165362f0b3ae300608b44f4e2a5fc6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The truth, of course, is that the English spirit is distrustful of emotion and display.",
      "output_sha256": "4102e290ea392f1ac122e822b9c94512c19ddf83d748ef26a545e930bdd21232",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "4102e290ea392f1ac122e822b9c94512c19ddf83d748ef26a545e930bdd21232",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There is a certain embarrassment in making \"a fuss,\" and heroics are met with disdain.",
      "output_sha256": "2e945642a922dea809d58dbcfb17ef591539aa71f12dd4259e672af9f350f8a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.449333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "85f7357c2e0d9aeba7dc69cea430a9bc0404f120d1627149427eb441dd6451d4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2e945642a922dea809d58dbcfb17ef591539aa71f12dd4259e672af9f350f8a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The typical Englishman hides his feelings even from his family, clothes his affections under a mask of indifference, and cracks a joke to avoid \"making a fool of himself.\"",
      "output_sha256": "86e89e8d0bdd4bd4fa24492043c8cf52bf66c35afdfc0a3fbf79e8e73f56c95e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "86e89e8d0bdd4bd4fa24492043c8cf52bf66c35afdfc0a3fbf79e8e73f56c95e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not that he is without great passions, but that he does not like talking about them.",
      "output_sha256": "dd3aecc5c061bf181638975d714ff36ed7297be25a79f82068c55b03956ba509",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd3aecc5c061bf181638975d714ff36ed7297be25a79f82068c55b03956ba509",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He is too self-conscious to trust his tongue on such big themes.",
      "output_sha256": "bc1a6c4fc2e2f75cfe54ce0fbc8840de349ad09e9afc20e94a9982166e2201ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc1a6c4fc2e2f75cfe54ce0fbc8840de349ad09e9afc20e94a9982166e2201ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He might \"make an exhibition of himself,\" and he dreads that above all things.",
      "output_sha256": "0713cefb5ffd1e24af91adc55bd9631dabfa1eb9bf9303a9483aad453b53bd9a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "0713cefb5ffd1e24af91adc55bd9631dabfa1eb9bf9303a9483aad453b53bd9a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This habit of reticence has its unlovely side; but it has great virtues too.",
      "output_sha256": "1afb4b173062bc9833a5283b0b2d2327498557b72aad45e589cb8753cbd98100",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "1afb4b173062bc9833a5283b0b2d2327498557b72aad45e589cb8753cbd98100",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It fosters a cool, practical mindset and cultivates a commonplace, good-humored atmosphere.",
      "output_sha256": "9fe1fc00d9286be257d97eb45ad1eebe5e1a90730dd05a387da06cdfe12a2b7b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.487706,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5697ac0b9425bb9cb2a09e4e6cf0224dc27bb42c6de4ef29bd1b55438cc2c73e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9fe1fc00d9286be257d97eb45ad1eebe5e1a90730dd05a387da06cdfe12a2b7b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It provides reserves of strength that those who live on their \"top notes\" do not possess.",
      "output_sha256": "82d2502fc57502ea28d0c4de0abb1a47bdcaef6bbf27074c0c42289a2907bc5e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.7125,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "58175c7d00ab121e031e77552845d5fa9eea2ff1f3d8593df7598b97b01c34e1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "82d2502fc57502ea28d0c4de0abb1a47bdcaef6bbf27074c0c42289a2907bc5e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It continues to hum \"Tipperary\" as if it were free of cares, indifferent to ideas or causes.",
      "output_sha256": "b0fa3511ec31e335a6ffafb000476d6dd71368ea6fc586f1daf3e10b57beeb96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.45027,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3e843049de5de1cb33fe8a2d56d4b8a5b8a2e852dac018dc6902bc7404f081b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b0fa3511ec31e335a6ffafb000476d6dd71368ea6fc586f1daf3e10b57beeb96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And then the big moment comes and the great passion that has been kept in such shamefaced secrecy blazes out in deeds as glorious as any that were done on the plains of windy Troy.",
      "output_sha256": "0a78b737a1c055d5fd77ee3efec43d73082e84b3b6a4a0bfdef9c815366961d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a78b737a1c055d5fd77ee3efec43d73082e84b3b6a4a0bfdef9c815366961d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Turn to those stories of the winning of the V.C., and then ask yourself whether the nation whose sons are capable of this noble heroism deserves to have the whip of Zabern laid across its shoulders by any jack-in-office who chooses to insult us.",
      "output_sha256": "53cc2c4237b4b7f0afb8ee61e309256af58d6eccf6a471824dd312e54acd44b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "53cc2c4237b4b7f0afb8ee61e309256af58d6eccf6a471824dd312e54acd44b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Those two stokers, lifting their heads for a moment of fresh air amidst the chaos of battle, exemplify the quintessential English character.",
      "output_sha256": "69368ec97f297117eb261d7db12868a6c8bc296ec6485411099e981ffc6eed35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.608371,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ed58ff5b591bd112195145573f2960a3647ee7bb4c8dc6eb497f235b051e1450"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69368ec97f297117eb261d7db12868a6c8bc296ec6485411099e981ffc6eed35",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Death loomed all around them, and any instant could have marked their last.",
      "output_sha256": "c015798c0ff13e58995e942258c13e764ba858fdaa653488a37de1da2c7ca482",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.586615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b8074326c68ccd26a574a9110c2dc910a5c379ef1c97bd678e15f765a80d3467"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c015798c0ff13e58995e942258c13e764ba858fdaa653488a37de1da2c7ca482",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But they were so completely masters of themselves that in the brief-breathing space allowed them they could turn their minds to a simple question of everyday conduct.",
      "output_sha256": "83ec51a371cb07a0c650928289fcfefe64c5b309d8a1772b075121a6481fe78c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "83ec51a371cb07a0c650928289fcfefe64c5b309d8a1772b075121a6481fe78c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"What I says is, 'e ought to have married 'er.\"",
      "output_sha256": "3e1a617089248dacfb51c43c6433c8bff22d5d098927058535f727a78bdcb464",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e1a617089248dacfb51c43c6433c8bff22d5d098927058535f727a78bdcb464",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This may not embody the essence of heroics, but it captures the very fabric of heroism itself.",
      "output_sha256": "c2ec968b31aa6215446f4e90012e017141305c4b7c1b3480f10d2ab03fd00e64",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.443464,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        65
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0cf04b423fb87e59670ce987130b69ea29bfb6b53080892d063d2782e7f6c690"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c2ec968b31aa6215446f4e90012e017141305c4b7c1b3480f10d2ab03fd00e64",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    }
  ]
}
